msgstr "<strong>Google Gemini (Google LLC)</strong>: Uploaded face photos and skin-related text information are sent for AI analysis."

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:141
msgid "Googleプライバシーポリシー"
msgstr "Google Privacy Policy"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:144
msgid "<strong>楽天株式会社（楽天API）</strong>：スキンケア商品の検索・取得のために商品名・カテゴリ情報を送信します。"
